{"id":"n32750-3-12","stage":1,"title":"나무 · 柴火","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32750-3-12-1","ko":"집에 땔감이 다 떨어졌네.","zh":"家里的柴火都用完了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땔감이","meaning":"柴火","explanation":"땔감：柴火；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땔감","audio":"/audio/dda0487b46153424ad87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53723","senseId":"1","lemma":"땔감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어졌네.","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"dda0487b46153424","term":"땔감","zh":"柴火","audio":"/audio/dda0487b46153424ad87.mp3","entryId":"53723","definition":"用于燃烧的木头。","pronunciation":["땔ː깜"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/68f997b0254765561c15.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32750-3-12-2","ko":"지금 산에 가서 나무를 한 짐 해서 가져올게요.","zh":"我现在就去山上挑一担木头回来。","not